  "label": "Maternal Role as Nurturing and Controlling",
  "description": "The image uses the stereotype of the maternal figure as nurturing, caring, and sometimes controlling, often associated with domesticity and emotional regulation. In this meme, the maternal figure is used to infantilize the protestor, implying that his political action is emotionally driven and needs to be 'fed' or 'taken care of' like a child.",
